OL,3,GNEWSAHopes #14m square will have
OL,4,A'ripple effect' on town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in a high-vis vest is hosing down
OL,7,Ffreshly laid paving slabs with a
OL,8,Fpressure washer ahead of the grand
OL,9,Fopening of a new public space in
OL,10,FBoston, Lincolnshire.
OL,12,FRosegarth Square has been transformed
OL,13,Fby the demolition of old buildings and
OL,14,Fthe creation of a new park, at a cost
OL,15,Fof #14.8m.
OL,17,FThe project is one of several in the
OL,18,Ftown to benefit from money from the
OL,19,Fgovernment's Levelling Up Fund, five
OL,20,Fyears after it was launched by then
OL,21,Fprime minister Boris Johnson in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
