OL,3,GNEWSAHopes #14m square will have
OL,4,A'ripple effect' on town
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Prior to this development, we had what
OL,7,Fyou might call tired public service
OL,8,Fbuildings," says Mike Gilbert, the
OL,9,Fdeputy leader of Boston Borough
OL,10,FCouncil, as he shows me around the new
OL,11,Fsquare.
